{"name":"Bharanidharan V","title":" Full Stack Developer","tagline":"Learning, building, and bringing ideas to life.","skills":["React","Node.js","Java","JavaScript","Python","ESP32","AI / ML","Drones","HTML","CSS","Git"],"about":{"intro":"Hello, I'm Bharanidharan, a Computer Science and Engineering student at LICET, Chennai. I'm someone who enjoys exploring technology, writing code, and turning ideas into working projects. I like learning by building, experimenting with new tools, and taking on challenges that push me beyond what I already know. From software development to drone technology, I'm always curious about how things work and how I can make them better.","education":"B.E. Computer Science and Engineering, LICET, Chennai","interests":["Coding","Software development","AI / ML","Drone technology"],"enjoy":"Learning new technologies, building projects, and taking part in competitions.","sections":[{"id":"coding","title":"I code","body":"Coding is one of the ways I bring my ideas to life. I enjoy solving problems, exploring different programming languages, and building applications that are useful in the real world. Every project teaches me something new, and I see every challenge as an opportunity to improve. I'm still learning, still experimenting, and always looking for something new to build."},{"id":"technology","title":"Tech is my thing","body":"What excites me about technology is how different fields come together to create something meaningful. I enjoy exploring software development, databases, AI, and embedded systems. Working with drones has also introduced me to the connection between code and the physical world. I love experimenting, understanding how things work behind the scenes, and discovering what I can create next."},{"id":"building","title":"I love building things","body":"For me, a project is more than just code. It's an opportunity to take an idea, understand a problem, and turn it into something people can actually use. Whether I'm developing a website, experimenting with hardware, or working with a team, I enjoy the process of learning, solving problems, and bringing ideas to life."},{"id":"teamwork","title":"Learning, teamwork and challenges","body":"I enjoy participating in competitions, collaborating with teammates, and sharing what I learn with others. As a drone team captain, I've gained experience working with people, exploring technical challenges, and conducting drone workshops. These experiences continue to help me grow as both a developer and a teammate."},{"id":"mindset","title":"My mindset","body":"I'm not someone who knows everything, and I don't pretend to. I'm here to keep learning, keep building, and get better with every experience. I believe that curiosity, consistency, and the courage to try something new can take an idea a long way."}],"closing":"Always learning. Always building. Always curious."}}